Maintainer: IoTemy Labs <brett@iotemylabs.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/iotemylabs/kali-purple-czd

Package: czd-boot-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, czd-purple-tokens (= ${binary:Version}), czd-wallpapers (= ${binary:Version}), grub-common, plymouth, plymouth-themes, initramfs-tools
Description: CZD Purple GRUB and Plymouth themes
 GRUB 2 bitmap theme (theme.txt, PF2 fonts, 9-slice selection pixmaps) and
 Plymouth script theme (splash and LUKS prompt) for the CZD Purple respin.
 Sets itself as the default on install and restores the previous defaults on
 removal.
